USER The openssl_primops.cc/openssl_primos.hh files define a C++ function called `primop_openssl_export_encrypted_pkey_pkey` which gets added as a nix builtins when the nix-crypto plugin is loaded. The function gets exposed with the name `export-encrypted-pkey-pkey` inside the `openssl` builtin attribute set.
