USER A function must be added to the nix library. Specifically, the `private-key` defined in the file 'crypto/openssl/main.nix' should be extended with the ability to call this function accepting a `private-key-spec-type` as argument. Look at the implementation of the `export-decryptable-pkey` function as the `export-encrypted-pkey-pkey` should work in a similar way.
